# Purpose:
# - Self-heal Google Drive conflict-copy corruption right after a merge/pull
#   pulls in whatever Drive dropped into .git while this machine was offline.
# Notes:
# - Husky v9 hook files are plain executable scripts without shebang boilerplate.
# - See AGENTS.md "Google Drive drift" for why this exists.

bash "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/scripts/clean-drive-drift.sh" --fix --quiet || true
